 The material explains that they simply compete with norepinephrine

00:28:52.400 --> 00:28:55.440
 and epinephrine to bind to the beta receptors in the heart and lungs,

00:28:56.000 --> 00:28:57.600
 blocking the sympathetic stimulation.

