 just like the agonists.

00:29:19.520 --> 00:29:22.160
 The blockers can be selective or non-selective.

00:29:22.160 --> 00:29:24.560
 Let's look at the selective beta one blockers first,

00:29:24.560 --> 00:29:26.960
 also known as cardio-selected blockers,

00:29:26.960 --> 00:29:28.240
 because they only target the heart.

00:29:28.800 --> 00:29:31.680
 There is a classic mnemonic provided in the text

