 It is absolutely contraindicated.

00:33:34.800 --> 00:33:36.640
 Okay, so you wouldn't give it to them?

00:33:36.640 --> 00:33:36.960
 Never.

00:33:37.760 --> 00:33:41.040
 But if a patient has healthy, robust lungs,

00:33:41.040 --> 00:33:44.160
 that mild airway narrowing is entirely unnoticeable to them.

00:33:44.800 --> 00:33:47.040
 And in exchange, a non-selective blocker

00:33:47.040 --> 00:33:50.080
 provides a much broader systemic dampening

00:33:50.080 --> 00:33:52.320
 of a hyperactive sympathetic state.

