 Migraine headaches.

00:34:00.640 --> 00:34:01.760
 Oh, I saw that.

00:34:01.760 --> 00:34:05.120
 The notes explicitly state that propanolol is used for migraines

00:34:05.120 --> 00:34:09.040
 because its lipophilicity allows entry into the CNS,

00:34:09.040 --> 00:34:10.480
 the central nervous system.

00:34:10.480 --> 00:34:11.600
 Okay, let's unpack that.

00:34:12.160 --> 00:34:13.280
 Lipophilicity.

00:34:13.840 --> 00:34:16.320
 Lipophilic means fat soluble.

00:34:16.320 --> 00:34:17.920
 The brain is protected by a fortress

00:34:17.920 --> 00:34:19.360
 called the blood brain barrier,

00:34:19.360 --> 00:34:22.160
 which is designed to keep toxins and most drugs out.

00:34:22.160 --> 00:34:24.080
 It's very, very difficult to penetrate.

00:34:24.080 --> 00:34:25.520
 A fortress, right.

00:34:25.520 --> 00:34:28.320
 However, highly lipophilic molecules

00:34:28.320 --> 00:34:31.840
 can slip right through the lipid membranes of this barrier.

00:34:31.840 --> 00:34:33.760
 Propranolol is highly lipophilic.

00:34:34.320 --> 00:34:35.920
 It doesn't just stay in the bloodstream.

00:34:35.920 --> 00:34:38.560
 It easily crosses into the central nervous system,

00:34:38.560 --> 00:34:40.880
 where it can block overactive vascular signals

00:34:40.880 --> 00:34:43.760
