 like a tinilol just can't cross that barrier effectively.

00:34:50.000 --> 00:34:50.720
 Oh, I see.

00:34:51.440 --> 00:34:54.240
 So if the sympathetic nervous system is like a

00:34:54.240 --> 00:34:56.160
