 You want to lower the volume on the entire physiological party.

00:35:21.280 --> 00:35:23.840
 And if the patient has the pulmonary reserve to handle it,

00:35:23.840 --> 00:35:27.120
 the non-selective drug is a far more powerful systemic tool.

00:35:27.120 --> 00:35:27.440
 All right.

00:35:27.440 --> 00:35:30.400
 So we've spent the first half of this deep dive heavily manipulating

00:35:30.400 --> 00:35:33.120
 the body's high stress fighter flight system from both sides.

00:35:33.120 --> 00:35:36.160
 We've flooded the engine and we've cut the wires.

00:35:36.720 --> 00:35:39.120
 But the human body has an entirely separate,

00:35:39.120 --> 00:35:40.240
